meta {
  name: 13 Approve
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/lab-reports/{{labReportId}}/approve
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Result Done → Approved (LABORATORY.docx §2.2, §6.6).

  If "09 Validate" deferred this report (`reportingDeferredUntil` set, in the
  future), Approve is blocked until that time passes — 422
  `REPORTING_WINDOW_CLOSED` with the unlock instant in the message (SRS
  §5.4/§5.5). `reportingDeferredUntil` is cleared on a successful approve.

  404 `LAB_REPORT_NOT_FOUND`. 409 `LAB_REPORT_LOCKED`. 409
  `INVALID_LAB_REPORT_TRANSITION` if the report isn't Result Done. 422
  `REPORTING_WINDOW_CLOSED` if still deferred to a later Reporting session.
}
